  "aiContextParagraph": "A violent incident occurred at a mosque in Pondok Kelapa, East Jakarta, during morning prayers when three worshippers were attacked. Following the event, local police launched an investigation and seized several items from the scene, including an axe and gasoline. The attack has drawn significant attention from public officials and religious authorities. The Ministry of Religious Affairs expressed regret regarding the assault, while representatives from the People's Consultative Assembly and political figures have called for the police to thoroughly examine the situation and take firm action against those responsible. Coverage of the event persists as authorities continue their efforts to hold the perpetrators accountable for the violence that took place in the house of worship. The investigation is ongoing as officials gather evidence and testimonies to clarify the circumstances surrounding the assault on the three victims.",
